# Root crontab for PiVPN watchdog
# Install with: sudo crontab -e
# Then paste the line below (replace YOUR_USERNAME with your actual username):
#
# The watchdog checks every minute whether tun0 exists when the OpenVPN
# service is active. If tun0 is missing, it restarts the service.
# This catches the rare case where the interface drops but the service doesn't.
#
# OpenVPN's built-in ping-restart 60 handles dead connections;
# this script only handles the tun0-vanishes edge case.

* * * * * /home/YOUR_USERNAME/.local/bin/pivpn-watchdog.sh
